{"title": "Conjure Minor Elemental: Azer", "pageid": 22262, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental:_Azer", "categories": ["Spells that last until long rest", "Spells", "Level 4 Spells", "Conjuration spells", "Actions", "Summoning actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer.webp/300px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer.webp, /w/images/6/6c/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer.webp/300px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Conjure Minor Elemental: Azer</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 4 conjuration spell</a>. It is a variant of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/25px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/38px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/50px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Minor Elemental\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/25px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental\">Conjure Minor Elemental</a> that summons an <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Azer\" title=\"Azer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png/25px-Portrait_Azer.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png/38px-Portrait_Azer.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png/50px-Portrait_Azer.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Azer\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png/25px-Portrait_Azer.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Azer\" title=\"Azer\">Azer</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nConjure an azer from the Plane of Fire. It deals both Bludgeoning and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage with its warhammer, and can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Overheat\" title=\"Overheat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp/25px-Overheat_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp/38px-Overheat_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp/50px-Overheat_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Overheat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp/25px-Overheat_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Overheat\" title=\"Overheat\">Overheat</a>. It carries the <a href=\"/wiki/Azer_Warhammer\" title=\"Azer Warhammer\">Azer Warhammer</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a> + <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/38px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/25px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 4 Spell Slot</a></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 18 m (60 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 18 m (60 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_ConjureElementals_Minor_Azer</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_ConjureElementals_Minor_Azer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_ConjureElementals_Minor_Azer\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetCharacter_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetCharacter (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetCharacter</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=CannotTargetItems_(spell_flag)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"CannotTargetItems (spell flag) (page does not exist)\">CannotTargetItems</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasSomaticComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasSomaticComponent (spell flag)\">HasSomaticComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/HasVerbalComponent_(spell_flag)\" title=\"HasVerbalComponent (spell flag)\">HasVerbalComponent</a></code>, <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Creature:_Azer\"> Creature: Azer </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div style=\"float: left; margin-bottom: 7px; margin-right: 7px; width: 160px; height: 160px; position: relative\">\n<div style=\"width: 120px; height: 120px; clip-path: circle(60px); position: absolute; top: 50%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Azer\" title=\"Azer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png/120px-Portrait_Azer.png.webp, /w/images/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png/120px-Portrait_Azer.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/95/Portrait_Azer.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div style=\"width: 160px; height: 160px; position: absolute\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Azer\" title=\"Azer\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/240px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/320px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png/160px-Portrait_Frame.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"160\" height=\"160\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/14/Portrait_Frame.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n</div>\n<table class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-table\"><tbody><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-score-row\">\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">STR</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>17</span></b></div> <span>(+3)</span>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">DEX</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>12</span></b></div> <span>(+1)</span>\n</td>\n\n<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>15</span></b></div> <span>(+2)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Intelligence\" title=\"Intelligence\">INT</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>12</span></b></div> <span>(+1)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">WIS</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>13</span></b></div> <span>(+1)</span>\n</td>\n\n\t\t<td>\n\t\t<p><a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">CHA</a></p>\n\t\t<div><b><span>10</span></b>\n<b></b></div><b> </b>\n</td>\n\t</tr><tr><td colspan=\"100%\" class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-divider\"><hr></td></tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/24px-Duration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/36px-Duration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/48px-Duration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Duration_Icon.png/24px-Duration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Duration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>Until long rest</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/36px-HP_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/HP_Icon.png/24px-HP_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/HP_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Hit Points</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>39</p></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"bg3wiki-attrblock-stat-row\">\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/36px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png/24px-Creature_AC_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/b0/Creature_AC_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Armour Class</p></td>\n\t<td colspan=\"3\"><p>20</p></td>\n</tr></tbody></table><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Overheat\" title=\"Overheat\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp/40px-Overheat_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp/60px-Overheat_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp/80px-Overheat_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Overheat\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp/40px-Overheat_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/76/Overheat_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Overheat\" title=\"Overheat\">Overheat</a> (<span aria-label=\"Bonus Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Release a fraction of your inner fire. All nearby creatures take damage and start <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Fiercely_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning Fiercely (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Burning Fiercely\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Burning_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Burning_Fiercely_(Condition)\" title=\"Burning Fiercely (Condition)\">Burning Fiercely</a>. </dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Smite_(Azer)\" title=\"Searing Smite (Azer)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/60px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/80px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Searing Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Searing_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Searing_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Smite_(Azer)\" title=\"Searing Smite (Azer)\">Searing Smite</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Your weapon flares with white-hot intensity. It deals, on top of weapon damage, an extra <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a></span></span> damage and marks the target with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon-wrapper\" style=\"display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-width: 25px; height: 25px;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Smite_(Condition)\" title=\"Searing Smite (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Searing_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Searing_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Searing_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Searing_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Searing_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Searing_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Searing Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Searing_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Searing_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Searing_Smite_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Searing_Smite_(Condition)\" title=\"Searing Smite (Condition)\">Searing Smite</a></span>. (<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/38px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Recharge: Once per battle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png/25px-Recharge_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Recharge_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Recharge: Once per battle.)</dd>\n</dl>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>This spell is a variation of:<br>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental\" title=\"Conjure Minor Elemental\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/60px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/80px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Conjure Minor Elemental\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp/40px-Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Conjure_Minor_Elemental_Azer_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Conjure_Minor_Elemental\" title=